## Task 2: Policy types and YAML builder

This is the core domain logic: converting form input into Tetragon TracingPolicy YAML. Use TDD — write failing tests first, then implement.

**Files to create:**
- `internal/policy/types.go`
- `internal/policy/builder.go`
- `internal/policy/builder_test.go`

