All required types are present in `types.go`: `PolicyFormInput`, `ProcessRule`, `FileRule`, `NetworkRule`, `TracingPolicy`, `ObjectMeta`, `TracingPolicySpec`, `LabelSelector`, `KProbeSpec`, `KProbeArg`, `KProbeSelector`, `BinarySelector`, `ArgSelector`, `ActionSelector`, and both constants `ActionPost = "Post"` and `ActionSigkill = "Sigkill"`.

