## Spec Compliance

**1. `handler.go` — Config struct and New():** Config has all five required fields (`Store`, `DynClient`, `JWTSecret`, `Namespace`, `TokenTTL`). `New` returns `http.Handler` via chi. JWT middleware reads the `sentinel_token` cookie. `writeJSON` helper is present. COMPLIANT.

